## 1. Product Identity & Vision

* **Product Name:** **Pragnya KisanPulse**
* **Tagline:** *From Passive Yield Numbers to Zero-Hardware Counterfactual Farm Decisions.*
* **Core Value Proposition:** **Pragnya KisanPulse** fuses 10m all-weather satellite indices ([Sentinel-1 SAR](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/data-collections/copernicus-sentinel-missions/sentinel-1) + [Sentinel-2 Optical](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/data-collections/copernicus-sentinel-missions/sentinel-2)), soil nutrient baselines ([Soil Health Card](https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2221117&reg=3&lang=1) + [ISRIC SoilGrids](https://un-spider.org/sites/default/files/GeoAI%20Compendium%202026.pdf)), and 7-day hyper-local weather forecasts to predict **uncertainty-bounded crop yields (`P10–P90`)** by Day 81 and simulate **"What-If" irrigation and fertilizer timing actions** that maximize yield while preventing water and urea waste.

